{"title":"Pirate Boat","slug":"Pirate_Boat","hero":null,"pageid":1607,"revid":13685,"timestamp":"2024-07-05T13:36:49Z","lastEditor":"Fjsh","categories":["Stores"],"infobox":{"type":"NPC","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Moves between islands"},{"label":"NPC","value":"Squallus"},{"label":"Purpose","value":"Sells Player Cannon"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.37.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"inventory","text":"Inventory"}],"body":"The <b>Pirate Boat</b> is a shop in Oaklands. It sells high-tier explosives. \n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The Pirate Boat is helmed by <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Squallus_the_Salty_Seadog/\">Squallus the Salty Seadog</a>.\n</p><p>The Pirate Boat itself moves between four specified locations: in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Map:New_Oaklands_Map?marker=28\">one of the branches</a> of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mike's_Mines/\">Mike's Mines</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Map:New_Oaklands_Map?marker=26\">on the far side</a> of the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave/\">Uncertainty Cave</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Map:New_Oaklands_Map?marker=27\">on the east shore</a> of Ferwater, or underground In the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/River_Caves/\">River Caves</a> near the waterfall.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"inventory\">Inventory</h2>\n<h3 id=\"structures\">Structures</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Player_Cannon/\">Player Cannon</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Player Cannon-Box\">Player Cannon-Box</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$36,000\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 id=\"items\">Items</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Large_Bomb/\">Large Bomb</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: LargeBombBoxed\">LargeBombBoxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$1200\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dynamite_Stick_x3/\">Dynamite Stick x3</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Dynamite Stick 3x\">Dynamite Stick 3x</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$1,500\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dynamite_Stick_x7/\">Dynamite Stick x7</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Dynamite Stick 7x\">Dynamite Stick 7x</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$2,500\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"}
